    <h2 class="reveal">How I Work</h2>

    <p class="reveal text-text-muted mb-8">A structured process built to produce measurable results: survey, plan, build, then measure. Technical foundations first, always.</p>

    <div class="not-prose grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 my-8">
      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <Icon name="search" class="w-6 h-6 text-accent mb-3" />
        <span class="eyebrow">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-brand text-base mt-1 mb-1.5">Discovery &amp; audit</h3>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm m-0">Technical health, content, and competitor gaps mapped against your Guildford market.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.08s">
        <Icon name="compass" class="w-6 h-6 text-accent mb-3" />
        <span class="eyebrow">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-brand text-base mt-1 mb-1.5">Strategy</h3>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm m-0">A prioritised roadmap by impact and effort, with technical remediation first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0.16s">
        <Icon name="gauge" class="w-6 h-6 text-accent mb-3" />
        <span class="eyebrow">03</span>
